{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transactions/section:txn-discharge.1", "amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#picture.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "a discharge naming txn-id seven, which no declare allocated and no outcome announced: the transaction-error family's own unknown-id, whose definition is that the specified txn-id does not exist. The id is deliberately not the first, so a register that answered 'live' for anything below a bound would still be refused here", "start": "session:MAPPED", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 18}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "txn-ctl", "type": "string"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 48}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "array", "constructor": "a3", "items": [{"text": "amqp:local-transactions", "type": "symbol"}]}], "type": "list"}}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "", "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000005902000001005312c04c09a10874786e2d6374726c4341404040005330c03501e03202a317616d71703a6c6f63616c2d7472616e73616374696f6e7317616d71703a6d756c74692d74786e732d7065722d73736e4040", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001e02000001005313c011074370000003e84370000003e843435201", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:transaction:unknown-id", "reason": "illegalState", "state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "refused"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 20}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "uint", "value": 1}, {"hex": "7431", "type": "binary"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "005377005332c00402520742", "type": "00"}}], "vector": "txn-discharge-unknown-id-refused"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transactions/section:txn-discharge.1", "amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#picture.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "txn-id zero discharged twice: the first discharge is admitted \u2014 the positive corpus walks the same exchange \u2014 and the second is refused, because a discharge is what says the txn-id is no longer in use and the id is therefore not one this endpoint holds", "start": "session:MAPPED", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 18}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "txn-ctl", "type": "string"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 48}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "array", "constructor": "a3", "items": [{"text": "amqp:local-transactions", "type": "symbol"}]}], "type": "list"}}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "", "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000005902000001005312c04c09a10874786e2d6374726c4341404040005330c03501e03202a317616d71703a6c6f63616c2d7472616e73616374696f6e7317616d71703a6d756c74692d74786e732d7065722d73736e4040", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001e02000001005313c011074370000003e84370000003e843435203", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 20}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"hex": "7430", "type": "binary"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "005377005331