{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transactions/section:coordination/type:declare/field:global-id.1", "amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transactions/section:coordination/type:declare/field:global-id.2", "amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#picture.1"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "a declare carrying global-id, where the coordinator's attach announced only local-transactions: the field's own clause forbids it, and the capability it names is the one the generated choice table spells \u2014 so the refusal is a field-value rule, which is the invalid-field condition's", "start": "session:MAPPED", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 18}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "txn-ctl", "type": "string"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 48}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "array", "constructor": "a3", "items": [{"text": "amqp:local-transactions", "type": "symbol"}]}], "type": "list"}}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "", "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000005902000001005312c04c09a10874786e2d6374726c4341404040005330c03501e03202a317616d71703a6c6f63616c2d7472616e73616374696f6e7317616d71703a6d756c74692d74786e732d7065722d73736e4040", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001e02000001005313c011074370000003e84370000003e843435201", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:invalid-field", "reason": "malformed", "state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "refused"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 20}, "type": "describe