{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transactions/section:transactions.u2", "amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#picture.1"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the id the controller was told about, the peer's detach, and then the commit it would have been entitled to before: closing the control link rolls back the transactions it created, so the id is no longer one this endpoint can commit. The detach releases the *peer's* handle, so this endpoint's own link state is what the transfer still names, which is why the refusal that arrives is the transaction rule's rather than the handle rule's", "start": "session:MAPPED", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 18}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "txn-ctl", "type": "string"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 48}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "array", "constructor": "a3", "items": [{"text": "amqp:local-transactions", "type": "symbol"}]}], "type": "list"}}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "", "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000005902000001005312c04c09a10874786e2d6374726c4341404040005330c03501e03202a317616d71703a6c6f63616c2d7472616e73616374696f6e7317616d71703a6d756c74692d74786e732d7065722d73736e4040", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001e02000001005313c011074370000003e84370000003e843435203", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 20}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"hex": "7430", "type": "binary"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "005377005331c00100", "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000001902000001005315c00c0542434340005333c0020143", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000000f02000001005316c0020143", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:transaction:unknown-id", "reason": "illegalState", "state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "refused"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 20}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "uint", "value": 1}, {"hex": "7431", "type": "binary"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "005377005332c003024342", "type": "00"}}], "vector": "txn-discharge-after-detach-refused"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transactions/section:transactions.u1", "amqp-core-transactions-v1.0-os.xml#picture.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "a transfer whose message body is a transactional-state, on the control link: the sentence says the link carries the declare and discharge messages and no transactional work, and the same composite in a disposition's state is the ordinary answer to a declare. The condition is the amqp-error family's illegal-state, the artifact's own value for a frame that is not permitted at the moment it arrives, because this sentence names no condition", "start": "session:MAPPED", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 18}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "txn-ctl", "type": "string"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 48}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "array", "constructor": "a3", "items": [{"text": "amqp:local-transactions", "type": "symbol"}]}], "type": "list"}}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "", "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000005902000001005312c04c09a10874786e2d6374726c4341404040005330c03501e03202a317616d71703a6c6f63616c2d7472616e73616374696f6e7317616d71703a6d756c74692d74786e732d7065722d73736e4040", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001e02000001005313c011074370000003e84370000003e843435201", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:illegal-state", "reason": "illegalState", "state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "refused"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 20}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"hex": "7430", "type": "binary"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "005377005334c0020143", "type": "00"}}], "vector": "txn-transactional-state-as-a-message-refused"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-types-v1.0-os.xml#picture.18", "amqp-core-types-v1.0-os.xml#picture.19", "amqp-core-types-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:types/section:composite-type-representation.2", "amqp-core-types-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:types/section:composite-type-representation.3"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the coordinator's capabilities carried the other way, and the contrast that makes the reading a vector: `coordinator`'s `capabilities` is declared `symbol` with `multiple=\"true\"`, and the representation the artifact gives a multiple field is an array whose elements are the declared type \u2014 picture.18 declares `book`'s `authors` that way and picture.19 carries it as 0xE0. Step 1 is the conforming form, the same attach with the capabilities as that array, admitted. Step 2 is the same attach with the field carried as a list of two symbols, where the values are not the declared type's, and the terminus is refused as the type violation both artefacts give. The sentence that states the representation \u2014 \"Multiple values are represented by the use of an array where the type of the elements in the array is the type defined in the field definition\" \u2014 carries no clause id in the ledger, so the citation is the artifact's own example rather than that sentence.", "start": "session:MAPPED", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 18}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "txn-ctl", "type": "string"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 48}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "array", "constructor": "a3", "items": [{"text": "amqp:local-transactions", "type": "symbol"}]}], "type": "list"}}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "", "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000005a02000001005312c04d09a10874786e2d6374726c4341404040005330c03601c03302a317616d71703a6c6f63616c2d7472616e73616374696f6e73a317616d71703a6d756c74692d74786e732d7065722d73736e4040", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:decode-error", "reason": "malformed", "state": "session:DISCARDING", "status": "refused"}}], "vector": "txn-coordinator-capabilities-as-a-list-refused"}
